# Origin of the CORS proxy in front of latitude.sh S3 (see worker/).
# Filled in once by whoever has Cloudflare access, from the URL
# `npm run deploy:worker` prints — the workers.dev subdomain is fixed per
# account, so it never changes again. Committed on purpose: it is not a secret,
# and it lets everyone else `npm run deploy` without wrangler.
# Left empty, the prod build talks to latitude directly and CORS blocks it.
VITE_S3_PROXY=https://stat-viewer2-s3-proxy.ddreamer1.workers.dev
